The Devils is a drama, history, horror film directed by Ken Russell.

3
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:46,000
Father Urbain Grandier’s unorthodox views of sex and religion make
him a polarizing figure in 17th-century France.

4
00:16:53,333 --> 00:16:59,333
His outspokenness has amassed a passionate following of nuns and a respected
reputation for protecting the city of Loudon from corruption.

5
00:21:06,666 --> 00:21:12,666
Grandier’s influence is then undermined following a sexually
repressed nun’s accusation of witchcraft.

6
